<body>
  <main class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</p>
    <h1>Everything you wanted to know about cats</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Cats are equal parts graceful athlete, curious explorer, and committed nap specialist.
      Browse these quick answers to learn more about feline behavior, care, and charm.
    </p>

    <section class="faq-list" aria-label="Cat FAQ">
      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-1">
